# Capture stopped into an empty clip: six keys at about 100 BPM, then SHIFT
# + REC; the core reads a tempo (three candidates, the fastest taken),
# starts the transport and opens its picker: SELECT takes the tempo before,
# KNOB1 the next again, and a key closes it (`capdone`) and plays nothing.
--key 0.10:7:100:0.2
--key 0.70:11:100:0.2
--key 1.30:14:100:0.2
--key 1.90:11:100:0.2
--key 2.50:7:100:0.2
--key 3.10:4:100:0.2
--button 3.40:SEL:0.1
--button 3.45:REC
--turn 3.60:SELECT:-1
--turn 3.70:KNOB1:1
--key 3.80:0:100:0.1
